WEBVTT

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.410
What a beautiful sky.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.420
Yeah, I guess.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.990
I'm surprised you have the gall to 
talk like that in this situation.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.990
Are you scared?

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.910
Why would I be?

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.410
Yeah, I'm scared.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.380
I can't think of how we're
actually going to win.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.710
Do Drakens not feel fear?

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.570
We don't fear death as much.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:36.170
But I don't want to be forced 
by fear into making decisions

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.330
that I'm dissatisfied with.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.050
I don't mind dying as a 
result of my own choices.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.470
That's why making a decision is a noble act.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:52.360
What one does and doesn't do
 determines their existence.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.090
That's correct.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.230
The lives of the 1,200 citizens currently 
on Rahzel Island hinge on this battle.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.890
The enemies are the Great Magatsushiki,

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.940
Janahn Ghalan and Amupura.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.290
If you want to run, do so now.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.040
No one will blame you.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.800
Chief, we're Offensive Jushikiists.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:13.960
Well said.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:14.920
Then...

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.840
Let's show them what we're made of.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.240
Let's send the Magatsushiki away.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.620
To the depths of hell!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.780
<b>Guillotine of Spiders • Time of Snakes</b>

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.200
They're coming!

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.290
Go back to the sea of shit in hell!

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.810
Make up your mind...
 Are you a horse or a knight?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.520
You talk too much.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.810
Keep your mouth shut.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.840
Now it's clear whether 
it's a horse or a knight.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.820
Yeah, I guess.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.580
Yo, what the hell is that?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.920
It's the bishop piece.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.460
But this is cheating!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.830
This is a group tactic. 
Don't forget it, Magatsushiki!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.320
Remedius Levvi Rahzel.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.080
He was indeed a genius.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.570
You've met him before?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.450
It was a long time ago.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.660
I challenged him on this board once.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.610
He won convincingly against me.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.710
You lost?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.180
He was one of a kind.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.740
If he hadn't been the one to inherit Rahzel...

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.470
<i>The decision has already been made.</i>

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.160
<i>But Remedius, your choice...</i>

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.840
They got Weitos.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.480
You piece of shit!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.700
You've finally solved the 
riddle and made your way here.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:10.450
But this wouldn't be a satisfying 
end to the evening party.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.080
The air here is stale.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.320
I'm going to dust the place off.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.040
Stand back.

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:19.460
All retreat!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.890
Par Ee Mon Jushiki.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.710
And it wove it in an instant.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.410
Its computational ability is off the charts.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.490
Are you not coming?

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:44.110
Then bathe again in the flames of hell.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.490
Amusing.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:51.550
Well met.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.120
I've been waiting for a hero like you.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.080
Gigina!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.870
Gigina, are you all right?

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.780
Welcome to our arena.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:19.650
Let's make the most of our evening party.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.140
Heroes of hell, fight me!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.660
What in the world is going on?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:39.340
They can win, can't they?

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.680
Tell me they'll win!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.540
Their current probability of victory is...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.060
No, forget it.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.320
<i>Please don't let any more people die.</i>

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:54.870
Iegie!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:59.720
I guess I'm going to have to change
 "Iegie the Dual-Wielder"

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.540
to "Iegie the Lone Sword."

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.070
Be quiet, or you'll make the bleeding worse.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.800
This is joyous.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.340
Joyous indeed.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.540
You're perfectly fit to be prey
 for the evening party!

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.820
How is his swordsmanship?

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:23.830
People long ago would have suspected 
him to be a warrior god.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.550
I have an idea.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.460
Are you in?

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:31.610
I don't trust your personality, 
but I trust in your slyness.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.560
Largonkin.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.780
Give me all the cigars you have.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.550
Pesky tricks...

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.260
I have Jiv's and 1,200 other people's
 lives at stake!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.610
I don't care about your wannabe warrior talk.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:59.120
This is not a place for a weakling like you!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.500
This is a sacred place of judgment 
between sword and shield!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.550
All attack!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.960
I-Impressive,

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.950
children of man...

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:39.950
I can't get to like you, 
but as a warrior, I didn't hate you.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.390
It wasn't a beautiful victory.

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.090
Don't be greedy.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:59.150
How did you stop Janahn Ghalan, anyway?

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.290
Poison gas Jushiki?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:05.770
No, that would have been 
disabled by that barrier...

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.930
I see. That's why you wanted the cigars.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.110
Bingo.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:15.110
The chemicals in tobacco used to 
be used as a natural insecticide.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:19.370
Janahn Ghalan's summon mediums were
apparently a human and a spider.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:23.830
Spiders' respiratory systems aren't 
well-equipped to filter out toxins.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.840
Janahn Ghalan inhaled the smoke 
without having been accustomed

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.940
to having a physical body.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:33.760
The burning of cigars is 
just a chemical reaction.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.010
His barrier wouldn't respond to it.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.540
It was partly a gamble, but...

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:42.550
Do you always make your 
battles so complicated?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.350
I told you not to talk, dummy.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.840
You two stay here.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.180
The rest of us will...

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:49.980
No!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:52.790
I want to fight with you until the end.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.490
You're one needy son.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.440
Take care of him, Jabeira.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.870
Grandma here is beat.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.660
You rotten bastards can deal with the rest.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:07.870
Let's go, Gayus.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:13.300
There's another freak waiting upstairs.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.590
Remedius...

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:38.490
If I die, you need to eat me...

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:43.950
so you can survive.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.920
Don't be crazy.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.500
We're make it home alive.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.660
We'll kill Dochetta,

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:58.260
and bring peace to Urmun.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.140
Remedius,

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:07.390
promise me that you'll save Urmun.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.140
Make it into a nation

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:15.100
where no one ends up like we did.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.010
Naricia!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.040
I love you.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.150
More than anyone else in the world!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.700
Naricia!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.020
Hey!

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:38.480
Answer me!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:39.240
Naricia!

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:39.770
Where are you?

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:40.670
Remedius!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:41.980
Remedius!

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.530
Answer me!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.700
I understand how you feel, 
but there's no way they're alive.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.280
That's not true!

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.100
But in this weather...

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.140
Hey, there's someone over here.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.740
Remedius!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.380
Remedius...?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.540
Naricia!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.410
Where's Naricia?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.810
They're all dead.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:14.830
But Naricia is inside of me.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.740
What do you mean by that?

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.220
I ate her.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:25.260
Naricia gave her body to me.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.350
You ate her?

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:29.880
This is the last of her.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.270
It can't be...

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.600
No...

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:39.020
With this, all of Naricia 
will be inside of me.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:47.870
The weak, foolish Remedius is already dead.

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:51.040
Offer to me your flesh and blood,

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:57.130
and I shall consume the enemies 
of Urmun without fail.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:01.690
That's right.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:02.730
I'm...

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.080
...the avenger.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.130
I'm the demon.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.530
And I'm...

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.990
the Man-Eating Dragon of the Sand, Zhuo Lu.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:19.870
Zemunn, you've put yourself 
to use as the late Remedius,

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.640
and set the board.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.890
This is the final move.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:28.470
Be gone, vile Rahzel.

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.080
Damn it, what a terrible gift to leave behind.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:41.340
At least we're alive.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:45.090
It's Salmak. It consumes the enemy's 
Jushiki power and turns them to stone.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.590
And Otis, which necrotizes
 the cells with snake venom...

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:52.100
It looks like Amupura's medium was a snake.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.850
It was definitely teleporting 
with that ability.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:14:00.650
We're lucky Amupura was drawn into 
the sky, just as we'd expected.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.360
How awful.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.990
Here we go!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.610
A brand new Amupura.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.960
How's that?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:24.250
Now with 1.46 times more Amupura 
than the leading brand!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:28.010
I couldn't see him regenerating.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.950
His teleporting, too... What is this?

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.760
Son of a bitch!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.160
I finally get it.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:38.390
He's using Goarp continuously.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:43.160
He's turning his body into information and 
converting it into subatomic particles.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.580
Then he transfers that as waves.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.700
And at the destination, 
he regenerates himself.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:55.240
His original body and his transferred 
body are both the same and not.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:58.060
He's switching his body out each time.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.000
You guessed it!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:05.130
Now, let's get to ending the evening party.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.920
Just so you know,

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:10.680
the Jushiki warheads are still right here.

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.640
Here's a question for you.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.310
How do we achieve victory against Amupura?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.120
We'll need a four-eyed redhead

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:23.060
to get eaten and destroy him from the inside.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:26.090
I'm the only one who fits that description.

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.840
What's your answer, then?

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.130
Win virtuously,
 by the judgment of a long history,

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.700
unbound by a petty word like "victory."

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:37.580
The only problem is that we'll die now.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.080
I guess.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:45.450
<i>If only we could blow this place up 
along with the Jushiki warhead...</i>

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.810
Well, well, Baron Janahn Ghalan.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.560
It's over for me.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:02.120
You don't have the Jushiki 
power left to regenerate?

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.850
What a pitiful sight.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:10.590
B-By the rules of the evening p-party, eat me.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.150
Indeed.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.840
You ate your own comrade?

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.580
We prioritize the survival 
of our species' information

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:26.210
over that of each individual.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:31.590
In that regard, I admire Remedius.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.840
By ingesting the girl he so loved,

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.350
he inherited her heroic will.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.980
Now, it's the end of the jolly evening party.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.210
Now that I've merged with Janahn Ghalan,

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:51.480
the conditions for the warheads' 
triggering have been met.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.160
It's time.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.640
The gods of death fly into the air

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:05.030
and circle Rahzel Island 
with their black hands.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.500
I won't let you!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.920
Eridana is my town!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.140
I won't let a single person die!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.470
I'm not playing, either.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.640
I can't let you stop it.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.900
What?!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.520
Gayus! Do it!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.160
Largonkin!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:50.040
The evening party and Remedius's 
revenge have failed!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:55.670
That, too, was within Remedius's plans.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:01.960
After it!

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:02.560
Yeah.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.060
Just so you know, I won't last.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.150
Do you have a way to stop it?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.200
I'll have to take a chance.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:24.990
I told you, I'm not playing, either.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.130
You have an adorable, ladylike shriek.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.100
Sink.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.310
Gayus, are you alive?

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:44.060
That woke me up...

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.880
The evening party is over.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:56.690
I've fulfilled my contract with Remedius.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:00.410
Now, come, my family!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.390
His goal was to summon his own kind.

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:09.710
But now that I know how 
the teleportation works,

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.460
he isn't immortal or anything.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.180
He's just prey.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.670
You're just a piece on a board.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:21.060
Squirm all you like, but this is checkmate!

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.960
I-I'm...

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:44.550
the ruler of the M-Magatsushiki!

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:49.000
I c-can't allow myself to be defeated now!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:52.330
The Eye of the Cosmos...

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.940
It's over.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.100
Why?

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:15.300
Damn it, Remedius...

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.400
He'd conned even the Great Magatsushiki.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:28.710
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.790
Jiv...

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:55.810
Largonkin had Jushikiists deployed <i>there</i>?

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.280
By the way, I take back what I said.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.480
If you don't get it, never mind.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.450
Also, one more thing.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.020
I'm out of Jushiki.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:11.950
You could have said that sooner!

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:21.380
Oh, you're still alive.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.580
I must be if you're still here.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.760
Otherwise, I'd be in heaven,

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:30.350
and you'd be in hell.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.240
I've come up with the right 
words to disappoint you.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.520
Today is the luckiest day of your life.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.540
This is my luckiest?

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.190
Gayus, is that you?

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.110
Gayus...

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.540
Er...

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.060
Sorry about last night.

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:53.190
You idiot! You don't have to lie like that...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.940
But, Jiv, I really...

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.560
Welcome home, Gayus.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:06.680
Finally... I finally got to say that to you.

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:12.090
I'm home, Jiv.

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.070
The mind is a kind of paradise.

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:57.040
It turns purgatory into paradise 
and burns paradise with ease.

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.570
There's no way to confirm

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:02.580
that the world you see and the 
world I see are the same world,

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.810
nor ought there be.

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:05.080
<b>Endgame of Sand</b>
